: \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, para o Trail de 16 km \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, copo\/recipiente para l\u00edquidos e manta t\u00e9rmica de sobreviv\u00eancia.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e como posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais realizam-se online na plataforma Cyclones Sports atrav\u00e9s do link direto disponibilizado no portal Portugal Running.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":53170,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497],"event_type_2":[726,820,62],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-51217","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-afife-viana-do-castelo","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-viana-do-castelo","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/20260725_cartaz.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51217","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=51217"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51217\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":65760,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalr